WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:05.430
This June, Netflix is boosting the quantity
and quality of their streaming selections.

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:09.650
They're rolling out nearly three dozen new
original movies and shows, including the hotly

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:14.459
anticipated second seasons of Luke Cage and
GLOW along with the series finale of cult

00:00:14.459 --> 00:00:15.459
hit Sense8.

00:00:15.459 --> 00:00:19.630
Plus, look for brand new action-packed blockbusters
to land on the streaming service this month.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:24.520
Here's everything coming to Netflix in June
2018, starting with all the Netflix originals.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:25.580
Busted!

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.580
Season Finale

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:30.990
Netflix's off-the-wall Korean detective comedy
Busted! premiered throughout May, with each

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:33.720
Friday seeing the release of two new episodes.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.329
Viewers have had plenty of time to get invested
in this motley crew of celebrity detectives

00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:42.380
as they work to gather clues and unravel mysteries,
and June 1st heralds the arrival of the season

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:46.129
finale, finally bringing closure to all those
quirky antics.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:48.309
November 13: Attack on Paris

00:00:48.309 --> 00:00:52.219
November 13, 2015 was a tragic day in Paris.

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:55.640
Terrorists perpetrated a series of bombings
and mass shootings in the French capital that

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.100
ultimately took 130 lives.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:01.850
To say that the horrific incidents affected
many in Paris would be an understatement,

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:06.840
and that's the focus of Netflix's documentary
series November 13: Attack on Paris.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:10.640
Through three gripping episodes, the series
will explore the terrorist attacks and their

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.520
emotional aftermath through candid interviews
with French citizens as well as first responders.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.810
Look for it on June 1st.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:19.810
The Break with Michelle Wolf

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:23.030
Comedian Michelle Wolf's brand new sketch
comedy and late-night show premiered on May

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:28.130
27th, and will continue throughout June with
new episodes each week, starting on June 3rd.

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:32.010
Tune in every Sunday as Wolf sits down with
celebrity guests and takes shots at politics,

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:34.240
modern life, and everything in between.

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:36.060
Alex Strangelove

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:39.750
Alex is a high school boy with a perfect life
who decides that he's finally ready to go

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:41.380
all the way with his girlfriend.

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:44.840
But when he meets a boy who makes him question
everything, he realizes that his life may

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:46.930
not be so perfect after all.

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:48.460
Look for it on June 8th.

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:49.929
Ali’s Wedding

00:01:49.929 --> 00:01:55.090
This award-winning Australian comedy-drama
follows a Muslim man named Ali who finds himself

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:58.940
caught between a rock and a hard place, or,
rather, caught between his family and the

00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:00.329
woman he loves.

00:02:00.329 --> 00:02:04.829
Starring comedian Osamah Sami and based on
Sami's own memoir, Ali's Wedding is sure to

00:02:04.829 --> 00:02:06.469
be an emotional crowdpleaser.

00:02:06.469 --> 00:02:08.800
Look for it to hit Netflix on June 8th.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.360
Marcella: Season 2

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:14.600
This first season of this British detective
series aired to glowing reviews, and Netflix

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:17.120
picked up the international rights immediately.

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:21.490
Starring Anna Friel, Marcella is about a retired
detective who rejoins the force in a state

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:25.800
of personal crisis after her husband decides
to divorce her and take the kids.

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:30.159
After she picks up a 15-year-old murder investigation,
Marcella slowly finds that her own life may

00:02:30.159 --> 00:02:32.520
be inextricably linked to the killer.

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:36.980
Season 2 of Marcella aired in Britain starting
in February 2018, and will be making its way

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:38.879
to Netflix on June 8th.

00:02:38.879 --> 00:02:40.900
Sense8: The Series Finale

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:45.060
This Netflix original sci-fi series is practically
a legend at this point.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:49.680
After two seasons, Netflix canceled Sense8
in 2017, claiming that it wasn't bringing

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:54.890
in enough viewers to justify its exorbitant
cost, rumored to be $9 million per episode

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:56.280
in Season 2.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.930
"Someone tell me just what in the hell is
going on here?"

00:02:58.930 --> 00:03:02.890
When the dust had all cleared, fans were left
with a massive cliffhanger and an insatiable

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:07.340
urge for more Sense8, leading to a flood of
online petitions to put the show back on the

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:08.340
air.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:11.349
It seems like someone at Netflix has heard
the cries for more, and a two-hour series

00:03:11.349 --> 00:03:15.190
finale is finally slated to land on Netflix
on June 8th.

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:16.190
The Staircase

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:20.890
In 2001, novelist Michael Peterson called
the police to report that his wife, Kathleen,

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:22.430
had fallen down the stairs.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:27.560
The ensuing police investigation honed in
on Peterson as the prime suspect, and in 2003,

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:30.310
Peterson was sentenced to life in prison for
the crime.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:34.239
"The injuries are not consistent with a fall
down the stairs."

00:03:34.239 --> 00:03:38.290
Netflix's upcoming documentary series The
Staircase takes a deep dive into the details

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:39.810
of the controversial case.

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:40.810
Did Peterson do it?

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:42.160
Was it an accident?

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.049
Was she attacked by an owl?

00:03:44.049 --> 00:03:47.780
Follow all the twists and turns when The Staircase
shows up on June 8th.

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:49.159
Lust Stories

00:03:49.159 --> 00:03:53.409
This anthology series explores life and love
in India through the lenses of four different

00:03:53.409 --> 00:03:58.190
filmmakers, each presenting a different film
about relationships, trust, and betrayal.

00:03:58.190 --> 00:04:00.019
Basically, the title says it all!

00:04:00.019 --> 00:04:01.920
Look for it on June 15th.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.090
Maktub

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:07.640
An Israeli dramedy, this film sees two bumbling
criminals decide to change their lives after

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.420
surviving a terrorist bombing.

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:13.000
Armed with a new purpose in life, they set
out to make wishes come true, specifically,

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.500
by nabbing people's written prayers from Jerusalem's
wailing wall.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:20.299
Together, they go on a chaotic journey as
they try to learn how to be good people.

00:04:20.299 --> 00:04:22.830
Look for Maktub on June 15th.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:23.830
Set It Up

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:27.340
Things get wild in Set It Up when two corporate
lackeys decide to try to get their high-strung

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:29.340
bosses to fall in love.

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:31.190
"When they're boning, we're free."

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:34.910
But when things inevitably go wrong with their
matchmaking plan, they start finding out that

00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:37.530
they have more in common with each other than
they thought.

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:40.090
Set It Up premieres on Netflix on June 15th.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:41.810
Sunday’s Illness

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:45.970
Described as an "aching, sweeping drama,"
Sunday's Illness is the emotional story of

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:50.180
a mother and her estranged daughter who spend
ten days at an isolated cabin together.

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:54.030
There, they slowly try to come to terms with
where their lives are now, and how things

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:55.330
could have been different.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:59.380
Experience the whole journey when Sunday's
Illness arrives on June 15th.

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:00.940
The Ranch: Part 5

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:04.150
Netflix's sitcom The Ranch has fallen on some
hard times.

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:08.690
Following continued allegations against actor
and co-executive producer Danny Masterson,

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:12.460
Netflix decided to write Masterson's character
out of The Ranch and continue without him.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:16.770
Still, the series is plowing ahead into its
third season, with Ashton Kutcher, Sam Elliott,

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.889
and Debra Winger reprising their roles.

00:05:18.889 --> 00:05:21.380
The first part of the new season drops on
June 15th.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:24.979
Club de Cuervos presents: The Ballad of Hugo
Sánchez

00:05:24.979 --> 00:05:29.240
The Mexican drama Club de Cuervos doesn't
seem like it has the makings of a cult classic,

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:32.130
but give it a chance, because there are a
lot of good surprises here.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:35.620
Centering on the brother and sister owners
of the Cuervos football club, the series is

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:38.930
a perfect mix of drama, crime, thrills, and
comedy.

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:43.680
Now, the series is producing its first spinoff,
which translates to The Ballad of Hugo Sanchez

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:48.639
and follows series regular Hugo Sanchez on
his own storyline within the Cuervos universe.

00:05:48.639 --> 00:05:50.910
Take a look on June 17th.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.229
Brain on Fire

00:05:52.229 --> 00:05:57.270
Based on journalist Susannah Cahalan's autobiography
Brain on Fire: My Month of Madness, this film

00:05:57.270 --> 00:06:01.680
follows the bizarre events which saw Cahalan
suffer an apparent mental breakdown that was

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:05.020
later diagnosed to be the symptoms of an autoimmune
disease.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:08.919
Chloe Grace Moretz stars as Cahalan, with
an impressive list of co-stars that includes

00:06:08.919 --> 00:06:11.130
Richard Armitage and Carrie-Anne Moss.

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:14.740
Don't miss Brain on Fire when it lands on
June 22nd.

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:16.080
Derren Brown: Miracle

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:20.620
Hot on the heels of his Netflix special The
Push, illusionist and mentalist Derren Brown

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:21.960
is back with Miracle.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:25.819
This time, Brown is taking to the stage to
subtly poke fun at blind religious beliefs

00:06:25.819 --> 00:06:30.000
even as he seemingly performs the same impossible
stunts that would push someone to believe

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.479
in a higher power in the first place.

00:06:31.479 --> 00:06:34.090
"The Lord removes your ability to read.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:39.289
Just so long enough to teach you a powerful
lesson about faith and belief."

00:06:39.289 --> 00:06:43.730
It's sure to be a head trip, so tune in to
get your mind blown on June 22nd.

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:45.900
Heavy Rescue: 401: Season 2

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:50.660
Tow trucks, fire trucks, semi trucks, there
are big trucks everywhere in Heavy Rescue:

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:51.660
401.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:54.889
If you were a kid who liked trucks and who
grew up to like trucks even more, you're bound

00:06:54.889 --> 00:06:56.860
to love this show about trucks.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:59.099
"There's the door of your transport truck.

00:06:59.099 --> 00:07:00.759
Can I get my truck right here?"

00:07:00.759 --> 00:07:04.840
Ride along with the guys who operate rescue
vehicles as they brave the harshest environment

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:06.730
imaginable: Ontario.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.990
Season 2 revs into gear on June 22nd.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.569
Marvel’s Luke Cage: Season 2

00:07:11.569 --> 00:07:15.360
Can anyone believe it's been over a year and
a half since Season 1 of Luke Cage first arrived

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:16.490
on Netflix?

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:19.370
Time flies when you're in denial, but the
wait is finally over.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:22.620
This time, Luke Cage is facing off against
the new villain Bushmaster.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:26.250
The unbreakable hero is set to reappear on
Netflix on June 22nd.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.470
Don't miss it.

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:28.470
Secret City

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:32.600
Filled with high-stakes thrills and political
intrigue, Secret City follows a journalist

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:35.900
who gets too close to the truth and uncovers
a web of conspiracies

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:40.780
Starring Anna Torv and Jacki Weaver, Netflix
describes this upcoming show as "dark and

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:42.900
cerebral," which sounds like a grand ol' time.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:44.750
Look for it on June 26th.

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.599
GLOW: Season 2

00:07:46.599 --> 00:07:50.419
Saturday night's alright for fightin' this
June, with an all-new season of the hit series

00:07:50.419 --> 00:07:51.419
GLOW.

00:07:51.419 --> 00:07:52.790
"We got a show to do.

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:53.979
What is this?"

00:07:53.979 --> 00:07:58.659
The Gorgeous Ladies of Wrestling make their
triumphant return in the ring on June 29th.

00:07:58.659 --> 00:08:00.120
Kiss Me First

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:04.250
In the near future, a young woman who's addicted
to a popular virtual reality game meets a

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:07.629
mysterious woman who shows her how dark the
game can actually get.

00:08:07.629 --> 00:08:11.009
With a hook like that, there's no doubt that
Kiss Me First will turn out to be a popular

00:08:11.009 --> 00:08:12.740
addition to Netflix's line-up.

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:14.680
Look for it on June 29th.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.110
Nailed It!: Season 2

00:08:16.110 --> 00:08:18.240
How many ways are there to bake a bad cake?

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:22.150
At least another season's worth, Nailed It:
Season 2 is preheating the oven for another

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:26.340
round of culinary monstrosities and the poor
folk who are just trying their best.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:28.680
Take a bite on June 29th.

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:29.680
Recovery Boys

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:34.770
From Elaine McMillion Sheldon, director of
the Oscar-nominated documentary Heroin(e),

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:38.970
Recovery Boys takes a long, painful look into
the opioid epidemic, focusing on four men

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:42.370
who are struggling to recover from addiction
and reenter society.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.220
Queue it up on June 29.

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:45.220
Tau

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:49.200
The sci-fi thriller Tau stars Maika Monroe,
Gary Oldman, and Ed Skrein.

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:54.130
The movie sees Skrein put on his Deadpool
pants again as shady supervillain Ajax - sorry,

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:59.220
Alex - who kidnaps a young grifter named Julia
and subjects her to a dangerous experiment.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:03.630
Escape seems impossible, since she's being
guarded by Tau, an advanced artificial intelligence

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:05.180
developed by Alex.

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:07.410
Take a look on June 29th.

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:08.670
Original stand-up comedy

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:12.940
With only two new stand-up specials to boast
in June, Netflix is doubling down on quality

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.500
over quantity on the comedy front.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:19.980
Both arrive late in the month - Hannah Gadsby:
Nanette shows up on the 19th, and a special

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:23.780
from W. Kamau Bell, which takes center stage
on the 26th.

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:27.500
That's it for the Netflix originals, now let's
turn to everything else arriving on Netflix

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.950
this June.

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:30.250
New movies

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:35.310
Netflix is blowing up the screen this June
with two of 2017's biggest action blockbusters

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:39.760
- Thor: Ragnarok, which sees Thor and the
Hulk teaming up to save Asgard from Hela.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:41.780
and Star Wars: The Last Jedi.

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:42.880
Haven't seen them yet?

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:46.460
You'll get your chance when Thor arrives on
the 5th and The Last Jedi shows up on the

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:47.460
26th.

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:48.460
"What's the matter with you?

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:49.460
You're embarrassing me.

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:51.930
I told them we were friends."

00:09:51.930 --> 00:09:56.211
Plus, relive some of the decade's best dramas
with The Departed arriving on June 1, The

00:09:56.211 --> 00:10:01.430
King's Speech on June 2, and The Imaginarium
of Doctor Parnassus on June 15, followed by

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:05.630
Martin McDonagh's irreverent 2008 crime comedy
In Bruges on the 16th.

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:09.110
"If I'd grown up on a farm and was retired.

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:11.620
Bruges might impress me, but I didn't, so
it doesn't."

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:14.910
In the mood for lighter fare?

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:18.020
Netflix is opening the month with some great
new romantic comedies.

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:22.940
On the first, look for Nick and Norah's Infinite
Playlist, Rumor Has It, and Just Friends.

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:24.560
"Chris!

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:25.720
Chris!"

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:27.310
"I'm busy!"

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:32.330
Also on the first, keep your eyes peeled for
the 2015 documentary He Named Me Malala, a

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:35.800
gripping look at the life of the youngest
Nobel laureate in history.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:39.580
Finally, Netflix isn't scaring up a ton of
new thrills this month, but there are a few

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:41.310
gems hiding in the mix.

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:45.790
June 1st will see the addition of Taking Lives,
The Covenant, and The Boy, a selection guaranteed

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.450
to keep you up all night.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:48.860
New television

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:52.710
You'll be glued to the TV this June as plenty
of new seasons of fan favorite shows join

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.420
the Netflix roster.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:59.850
Season 2 of Wynonna Earp drops on June 9th,
Season 8 of Portlandia on June 10th, and on

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:03.720
June 16th, hold on tight for the emotional
final season of Grey's Anatomy.

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:07.500
Plus, be sure to check out the first season
of Marlon Wayans' new sitcom Marlon on the

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:08.500
14th.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:13.420
Finally, Supergirl Season 3 and iZombie Season
4 are slated to arrive once they finish airing

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:16.140
on the CW, and Marvel's Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:18.200
drops its 5th season on June 17th.

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:20.730
That's a whole lot of excitement for one month.

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:21.730
Thanks for watching!

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:23.930
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:26.019
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

